  "result": "I've fixed all three digest problems. The changed files type-check cleanly, but I haven't run the test suite.\n\n1. **Only opted-in people get a digest:** in `src/server/repositories/notification-preference-repository.ts`, `listDigestSubscribers` now only returns people who chose digest delivery for at least one kind of notification. Before, it returned anyone with any saved notification setting in the workspace.\n2. **Most recent updates are kept:** in `src/server/services/digest-service.ts`, `buildDigest` now sorts updates newest first before applying the cap. The digest keeps the most recent ones and the email's headline is the latest update.\n3. **Archived workspaces send nothing:** both `runDigestEmailJob` in `src/server/jobs/digest-email-job.ts` and `buildDigest` now skip archived workspaces. Live workspaces work as before.",
